1. FarPlay Service Overview

FarPlay enables end users (e.g., musicians and other performers) to collaborate over distances with low-latency audio and, where available, video, augmented by a portfolio of production-relevant tools. Access to the Service is provided by the downloadable FarPlay application and related websites and account-based features, freely available at https://farplay.io/download.

FarPlay may be used in several ways, including: • using the application for free without registering for an account; • using the application for free with a free account; • using the application with a Subscription that enables access to enhanced features; and • using the application with a Subscription that enables access to enhanced features and may include access to FarPlay Meet.

A “Subscription” means any plan that enables access to enhanced features, including plans that begin with a free trial period.

FarPlay Meet 

FarPlay Meet is an optional component of the Service that provides web-based discovery and social features, including profiles, listings, messaging, and user-generated content tools. Use of FarPlay Meet is subject to these Terms.

